Here is the UI designed to present a list of eight items with their titles, statuses, and details, complete with a clean layout and filter options.

We use:
- A `segmented_control` to act as the status filter selector (All, Active, Pending, Completed).
- An `entity_list` to cleanly display the eight individual items alongside status indicators and subtitles.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "filterable-items-list",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "filterable-items-list",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 1,
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "header-title",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Project Deliverables & Milestones"
              },
              {
                "id": "status-filter",
                "component": "segmented_control",
                "name": "status_filter",
                "selected_value": "all",
                "options": "[{\"label\": \"All Items (8)\", \"value\": \"all\"}, {\"label\": \"Active\", \"value\": \"active\"}, {\"label\": \"Pending\", \"value\": \"pending\"}, {\"label\": \"Completed\", \"value\": \"completed\"}]"
              },
              {
                "id": "items-list",
                "component": "entity_list",
                "items": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "description": "List of the eight items with title, subtitle, status, and icon.",
                  "value": [
                    {
